0e02f8b7-3b13-43a1-9b18-019bea4e57d3	0	/uploads/floorplans/ACAD_floor0.jpg	[[6.9699, 79.90477], [6.9706, 79.90547]]	2026-06-09 18:17:40.684	37d3578c-4287-487f-afbb-b91e05d7894f	{"x0": 0, "x1": 100, "y0": 0, "y1": 70.7}	0.45	# ADMINISTRATION BUILDING - GROUND FLOOR NAVIGATION GUIDE\n\n## MAIN ENTRANCE\n\nThe main entrance is located on the eastern side of the Ground Floor, directly beside the Reception area.\n\nWhen entering the building:\n\n* Reception is immediately ahead and slightly to the left.\n* Student Waiting Lobby opens directly beyond Reception.\n* Meeting Room, Lift, and Staircase are located toward the upper-left side of the entrance area.\n* Administrative offices are located along the southern corridor.\n* Cafeteria is located on the far western side of the floor.\n\n---\n\n# FLOOR DIRECTORY\n\n| Room No | Location                   |\n| ------- | -------------------------- |\n| 1       | Reception                  |\n| 2       | Student Waiting Lobby      |\n| 3       | Cafeteria                  |\n| 4       | Meeting Room               |\n| 5       | Security Room              |\n| 6       | Office for Student Affairs |\n| 7       | Shroff Office              |\n| 8       | Breast Feeding Room        |\n| 9       | ELV Room                   |\n| 10      | Electrical Room            |\n| -       | Lift                       |\n| -       | Staircase                  |\n| -       | Toilets                    |\n\n---\n\n# ROUTES FROM MAIN ENTRANCE\n\n## Reception (Room 1)\n\nDirections:\nEnter through the main entrance. Reception is immediately inside the building and is the first room you encounter.\n\nDistance:\nVery close to entrance.\n\nLandmark:\nMain information counter.\n\n---\n\n## Student Waiting Lobby (Room 2)\n\nDirections:\nEnter through the main entrance and continue straight past Reception.\n\nLandmark:\nLarge open central area connecting all major destinations.\n\nPurpose:\nMain circulation and waiting area.\n\n---\n\n## Meeting Room (Room 4)\n\nDirections:\n\n1. Enter through the main entrance.\n2. Walk through Reception.\n3. Continue toward the upper-left side of the floor.\n4. The Meeting Room is located beside the Lift and below the Staircase.\n\nNearby Facilities:\n\n* Lift\n* Staircase\n\nLandmark:\nLocated directly next to the Lift.\n\n---\n\n## Lift\n\nDirections:\n\n1. Enter through the main entrance.\n2. Walk past Reception.\n3. Continue toward the upper-left side of the floor.\n4. The Lift is located beside the Meeting Room.\n\nAccessibility:\nWheelchair accessible.\n\n---\n\n## Staircase\n\nDirections:\n\n1. Enter through the main entrance.\n2. Proceed toward the Lift area.\n3. The Staircase is immediately above the Lift.\n\nPurpose:\nAccess to upper floors.\n\n---\n\n## Cafeteria (Room 3)\n\nDirections:\n\n1. Enter through the main entrance.\n2. Walk through Reception.\n3. Continue across the Student Waiting Lobby.\n4. Proceed toward the far western side of the floor.\n5. The Cafeteria occupies the large room at the western end.\n\nLandmark:\nLargest room on the floor.\n\nNearby Areas:\n\n* Student Waiting Lobby\n\n---\n\n## Security Room (Room 5)\n\nDirections:\n\n1. Enter through the main entrance.\n2. Walk into the Student Waiting Lobby.\n3. Move toward the southern corridor.\n4. Security Room is the first office along the corridor.\n\nLandmark:\nFirst office after entering the office corridor.\n\n---\n\n## Office for Student Affairs (Room 6)\n\nDirections:\n\n1. Enter through the main entrance.\n2. Walk through the Student Waiting Lobby.\n3. Proceed along the southern office corridor.\n4. Pass Security Room.\n5. The next office is the Office for Student Affairs.\n\nLandmark:\nLocated between Security Room and Shroff Office.\n\n---\n\n## Shroff Office (Room 7)\n\nDirections:\n\n1. Enter through the main entrance.\n2. Walk through the Student Waiting Lobby.\n3. Continue along the southern office corridor.\n4. Pass Security Room.\n5. Pass Office for Student Affairs.\n6. The next office is the Shroff Office.\n\nPurpose:\nStudent payments and financial services.\n\n---\n\n## Breast Feeding Room (Room 8)\n\nDirections:\n\n1. Enter through the main entrance.\n2. Walk through the Student Waiting Lobby.\n3. Continue along the southern office corridor.\n4. Pass Security Room.\n5. Pass Office for Student Affairs.\n6. Pass Shroff Office.\n7. The next room is the Breast Feeding Room.\n\nPurpose:\nPrivate nursing facility.\n\n---\n\n## ELV Room (Room 9)\n\nDirections:\n\n1. Enter through the main entrance.\n2. Walk through the Student Waiting Lobby.\n3. Continue toward the western side of the southern corridor.\n4. Pass Security Room, Office for Student Affairs, Shroff Office, and Breast Feeding Room.\n5. The ELV Room is located near the toilet area.\n\nLandmark:\nClosest room to the toilets.\n\n---\n\n## Electrical Room (Room 10)\n\nDirections:\n\n1. Enter through the main entrance.\n2. Walk across the Student Waiting Lobby toward the western side.\n3. Continue past the ELV Room.\n4. The Electrical Room is the last room on the far western side of the floor.\n\nLandmark:\nFurthest room from the entrance.\n\n---\n\n## Toilets\n\nDirections:\n\n1. Enter through the main entrance.\n2. Walk through the Student Waiting Lobby.\n3. Continue toward the south-western corner of the floor.\n4. The toilets are located beside the ELV Room and near the Electrical Room.\n\nFacilities:\n\n* Male Toilet\n* Female Toilet\n* Accessible Toilet\n\nAccessibility:\nWheelchair accessible toilet available.\n\n---\n\n# ROOM ORDER FROM EAST TO WEST\n\nStarting from the Main Entrance:\n\nReception (1)\n→ Student Waiting Lobby (2)\n→ Security Room (5)\n→ Office for Student Affairs (6)\n→ Shroff Office (7)\n→ Breast Feeding Room (8)\n→ ELV Room (9)\n→ Electrical Room (10)\n\n---\n\n# CLOSEST FACILITIES\n\nClosest facility to Entrance:\n\n* Reception\n\nClosest facility to Lift:\n\n* Meeting Room\n\nClosest facility to Staircase:\n\n* Meeting Room\n\nClosest facility to Toilets:\n\n* ELV Room\n\nClosest facility to Cafeteria:\n\n* Student Waiting Lobby\n\nClosest facility to Student Affairs Office:\n\n* Shroff Office\n\nClosest facility to Shroff Office:\n\n* Office for Student Affairs\n\nFurthest room from Entrance:\n\n* Electrical Room\n\nLargest room:\n\n* Cafeteria\n\nMain navigation hub:\n\n* Student Waiting Lobby	\N	PUBLISHED	2026-06-16 06:18:56.318	/uploads/floorplans/ACAD_floor0.jpg	[{"x": 52.827140479582, "y": 72.0885419845581, "id": "8e36704f-0af7-49b5-b8ec-363189405761", "label": "CAFETERIA", "legendNumber": 7}, {"x": 52.827140479582, "y": 22.651042938232422, "id": "c3d0d5d9-3956-47f0-a7ea-62a80f06cc28", "label": "CAREER GUIDANCE UNIT", "legendNumber": 2}, {"x": 51.31260093694878, "y": 25.46354293823242, "id": "0e4fadf1-1b98-4377-b593-838d240868e2", "label": "DIRECTOR'S ROOM", "legendNumber": 3}, {"x": 56.86591259327057, "y": 39.73437309265137, "id": "33d76f7e-3586-4fe3-b838-608ecf7a4ee1", "label": "ENTRANCE FOR ENTRANCE OF THE FACULTY", "legendNumber": 12}, {"x": 54.240710719373006, "y": 36.41145706176758, "id": "eedcb9f7-ae66-4e01-9a0d-28772c1abc0d", "label": "ENTRANCE FOR THE STAIRCASE & LIFT 1", "legendNumber": 8}, {"x": 54.34168002221522, "y": 70.50000190734863, "id": "c91ef0cf-c398-4bc1-a274-39d625d2c7f7", "label": "ENTRANCE FOR THE STAIRCASE & LIFT 2", "legendNumber": 10}, {"x": 55.45234235347958, "y": 24.526042938232422, "id": "760f2bdc-c305-4c11-bd79-8ef5fe45b15b", "label": "ENTRANCE LOBBY", "legendNumber": 1}, {"x": 52.827140479582, "y": 54.52604293823242, "id": "44954110-565f-4f69-9a40-c9122ed47c52", "label": "GENERAL COMPUTER LAB 1", "legendNumber": 4}, {"x": 51.81744745115986, "y": 41.25, "id": "0406e6cc-6abb-4a9d-ab05-af5193840b3c", "label": "IT LAB REPAIR ROOM", "legendNumber": 6}, {"x": 53.02907908526643, "y": 65.5260419845581, "id": "35167c97-2955-4850-ad7c-f12edd52e5a0", "label": "IT LAB STORE", "legendNumber": 5}, {"x": 54.240710719373006, "y": 32.99479007720947, "id": "6182d281-18e2-4375-bbd3-4edcb374bd2f", "label":