e06986e2-f832-449b-8f67-6c76da22a564	0	/uploads/floorplans/ADMIN_floor0.jpg	[[6.9700999999999995, 79.90473], [6.9708, 79.90543]]	2026-05-23 06:43:17.175	af76a845-065f-44b0-9ef4-12d783ee49c6	{"x0": 0, "x1": 100, "y0": 0, "y1": 74.6}	\N	# GROUND FLOOR NAVIGATION KNOWLEDGE BASE\n\n## FLOOR INFORMATION\n\nFloor Name: Ground Floor\n\nDescription:\nThe Ground Floor consists of a central public circulation area called the Student Waiting Lobby. Most destinations on the floor are accessible through this lobby. The Reception is located on the eastern side of the floor near the main entrance. The Cafeteria occupies the western side. Administrative offices are located along the southern corridor. Vertical transportation facilities including Lift and Staircase are located near the Meeting Room.\n\n---\n\n# ROOM DIRECTORY\n\n## Room 1 - Reception\n\nPurpose:\nVisitor reception and information services.\n\nLocation:\nEastern side of the floor.\n\nNearby Locations:\n\n* Student Waiting Lobby\n* Meeting Room\n* Lift Area\n\nConnected To:\n\n* Main Entrance\n* Student Waiting Lobby\n\nNavigation Landmark:\nPrimary arrival point for visitors.\n\n---\n\n## Room 2 - Student Waiting Lobby\n\nPurpose:\nMain public waiting and circulation area.\n\nLocation:\nCenter of the floor.\n\nNearby Locations:\n\n* Reception\n* Cafeteria\n* Meeting Room\n* Security Room\n* Office for Student Affairs\n* Shroff Office\n* Breast Feeding Room\n* ELV Room\n\nConnected To:\n\n* Reception\n* Cafeteria\n* Meeting Room\n* Administrative Corridor\n\nNavigation Landmark:\nMain navigation hub of the Ground Floor.\n\nImportant Note:\nMost routes on the Ground Floor pass through the Student Waiting Lobby.\n\n---\n\n## Room 3 - Cafeteria\n\nPurpose:\nFood and refreshments area.\n\nLocation:\nNorth-western side of the floor.\n\nNearby Locations:\n\n* Student Waiting Lobby\n\nConnected To:\n\n* Student Waiting Lobby\n\nNavigation Landmark:\nLargest room on the western side of the floor.\n\nDirections:\nFrom Reception, walk through the Student Waiting Lobby and continue toward the western side.\n\n---\n\n## Room 4 - Meeting Room\n\nPurpose:\nMeetings and discussions.\n\nLocation:\nNorth-eastern side of the floor.\n\nNearby Locations:\n\n* Lift\n* Staircase\n* Reception\n\nConnected To:\n\n* Student Waiting Lobby\n\nNavigation Landmark:\nLocated directly beside the Lift and Staircase area.\n\nDirections:\nFrom Reception, move toward the Lift area. The Meeting Room is adjacent to the Lift.\n\n---\n\n## Room 5 - Security Room\n\nPurpose:\nSecurity operations and monitoring.\n\nLocation:\nSouthern corridor.\n\nNearby Locations:\n\n* Office for Student Affairs\n\nConnected To:\n\n* Student Waiting Lobby\n\nDirections:\nFrom Reception, enter the Student Waiting Lobby and proceed along the southern corridor. The Security Room is the first office on the corridor.\n\n---\n\n## Room 6 - Office for Student Affairs\n\nPurpose:\nStudent administrative services.\n\nLocation:\nSouthern corridor.\n\nNearby Locations:\n\n* Security Room\n* Shroff Office\n\nConnected To:\n\n* Student Waiting Lobby\n\nDirections:\nFrom Reception, enter the Student Waiting Lobby and continue along the southern corridor. The Office for Student Affairs is located between the Security Room and the Shroff Office.\n\n---\n\n## Room 7 - Shroff Office\n\nPurpose:\nFinancial and payment services.\n\nLocation:\nSouthern corridor.\n\nNearby Locations:\n\n* Office for Student Affairs\n* Breast Feeding Room\n\nConnected To:\n\n* Student Waiting Lobby\n\nDirections:\nFrom Reception, enter the Student Waiting Lobby and proceed along the southern corridor. The Shroff Office is located after the Office for Student Affairs.\n\n---\n\n## Room 8 - Breast Feeding Room\n\nPurpose:\nPrivate nursing facility.\n\nLocation:\nSouthern corridor.\n\nNearby Locations:\n\n* Shroff Office\n* ELV Room\n\nConnected To:\n\n* Student Waiting Lobby\n\nDirections:\nLocated along the southern corridor between the Shroff Office and ELV Room.\n\n---\n\n## Room 9 - ELV Room\n\nPurpose:\nExtra Low Voltage systems and infrastructure.\n\nLocation:\nSouth-western side near toilets.\n\nNearby Locations:\n\n* Breast Feeding Room\n* Toilets\n* Electrical Room\n\nConnected To:\n\n* Student Waiting Lobby\n\nDirections:\nProceed through the southern corridor toward the western side.\n\n---\n\n## Room 10 - Electrical Room\n\nPurpose:\nElectrical distribution and maintenance systems.\n\nLocation:\nFar western side of the floor.\n\nNearby Locations:\n\n* ELV Room\n\nConnected To:\n\n* Student Waiting Lobby\n\nDirections:\nLocated beyond the ELV Room on the western side of the floor.\n\n---\n\n# FACILITIES\n\n## Lift\n\nPurpose:\nVertical transportation between floors.\n\nLocation:\nNorth-eastern side beside Meeting Room.\n\nNearby Locations:\n\n* Meeting Room\n* Staircase\n* Reception\n\nAccessibility:\nWheelchair Accessible\n\nDirections:\nFrom Reception, proceed toward the Meeting Room area. The Lift is adjacent to the Meeting Room.\n\n---\n\n## Staircase\n\nPurpose:\nAccess to upper floors.\n\nLocation:\nNorth-eastern side beside Lift.\n\nNearby Locations:\n\n* Lift\n* Meeting Room\n\nDirections:\nLocated immediately beside the Lift.\n\nAccessibility:\nNot suitable for wheelchair users.\n\n---\n\n## Toilets\n\nPurpose:\nPublic restroom facilities.\n\nLocation:\nSouth-western side near ELV Room.\n\nNearby Locations:\n\n* ELV Room\n* Electrical Room\n\nFacilities Available:\n\n* Male Toilet\n* Female Toilet\n* Accessible Toilet\n\nAccessibility:\nWheelchair Accessible Toilet Available\n\nDirections:\nFrom Reception, pass through the Student Waiting Lobby and continue toward the western side of the southern corridor.\n\n---\n\n# RELATIVE LOCATION KNOWLEDGE\n\nReception is east of Student Waiting Lobby.\n\nStudent Waiting Lobby is west of Reception.\n\nCafeteria is west of Student Waiting Lobby.\n\nMeeting Room is north-east of Student Waiting Lobby.\n\nLift is adjacent to Meeting Room.\n\nStaircase is adjacent to Lift.\n\nSecurity Room is south of Student Waiting Lobby.\n\nOffice for Student Affairs is west of Security Room.\n\nShroff Office is west of Office for Student Affairs.\n\nBreast Feeding Room is west of Shroff Office.\n\nELV Room is west of Breast Feeding Room.\n\nElectrical Room is west of ELV Room.\n\nToilets are located near ELV Room.\n\n---\n\n# ACCESSIBILITY RULES\n\nIf user requires wheelchair access:\n\n* Use Lift instead of Staircase.\n* Recommend Accessible Toilet when restroom is requested.\n* Avoid routes containing stairs.\n* Prioritize routes through open lobby spaces.\n\n---\n\n# NAVIGATION RESPONSE RULES\n\nWhen answering user questions:\n\n1. Mention the destination.\n2. Mention nearby landmarks.\n3. Provide step-by-step directions.\n4. Mention Lift or Accessible Toilet when relevant.\n5. Use Reception and Student Waiting Lobby as primary reference points.\n\nExample:\n\nQuestion:\n"How do I get to the Shroff Office?"\n\nAnswer:\n"From Reception, enter the Student Waiting Lobby and walk along the southern corridor. Pass the Security Room and Office for Student Affairs. The Shroff Office is the next office along the corridor."\n\nQuestion:\n"Where is the nearest toilet?"\n\nAnswer:\n"From Reception, walk through the Student Waiting Lobby toward the western side of the southern corridor. The toilet facilities are located near the ELV Room. An accessible toilet is also available."\n\nQuestion:\n"Where is the Lift?"\n\nAnswer:\n"The Lift is located beside the Meeting Room on the north-eastern side of the Ground Floor. From Reception, walk toward the Meeting Room area and you will find the Lift adjacent to it."	\N	PUBLISHED	2026-06-16 05:41:49.568	/uploads/floorplans/ADMIN_floor0.jpg	[{"x": 45.45638137210035, "y": 42.65625, "id": "9ab83ddc-a0d8-4e5c-8aa8-cc0abe03a04e", "label": "BREAST FEEDING ROOM", "legendNumber": 8}, {"x": 43.53796461809828, "y": 32.65625, "id": "0a66c0fc-35c8-4b27-b6ca-183a6b389485", "label": "CAFETARIA", "legendNumber": 3}, {"x": 40.7108241385162